Missing pages
-------------

src/components/SideBar.tsx renders seven nav items. Two of them point at
routes that do not exist in App.tsx:

	/app/activities   Activities
	/app/settings     Settings

Both currently hit the catch-all and redirect to Overview, so the sidebar
advertises features a user cannot reach. The backend endpoints already exist:

	Activities   GET/POST/DELETE /area, POST/DELETE /area/:id/activity
	             the facility areas and their sub-activities the mobile log
	             screen browses
	Settings     GET/POST/DELETE /admin, admin account management

Building these two pages is the largest outstanding item in this repository.
Until they exist, either build them or remove the nav entries; leaving broken
links is the worse of the three options.


